5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is lovely that we are doing this together. I am curious about how our seating affects our communication. I will look into the two project strands within earshot and what the new joiners reported.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I agree that we should be thorough. I want to understand the distribution of the space and how it has been handled. I will look into the drawn plan against the staff survey and unplanned seat shuffles.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Um... if that's okay, I'd like to check the basis of the department's floor billing and the facilities quote for re-running power and network. I just want to make sure we're being careful with the costs.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mio,,I'm excited to get this sorted! I want to know how the actual transition and our daily starts affect us. I'll look into the morning routine on the pilot floor and the arrival times in the badge records!,"{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Since everyone else is focusing on the social and financial side, I'll handle the physical environment. I'll look into the sound meter readings and the physio's note from the workstation check.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"It seems we have a very balanced approach. @Toshio, @Daisuke, @Mio, and @Shunichi, thank you for covering so many different angles. I feel we will have a wonderful foundation for our decision.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Daisuke"",""Mio"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"Indeed. By dividing the research this way, we avoid redundancy and ensure that no single perspective dominates the decision. I believe this is the most efficient way to proceed.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree. I'm glad everyone is okay with this. I'll do my best to find the information we need.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mio,,I'm just so curious to see what the badge records say! I wonder if we all arrive at the same time or if there's a big gap. This is going to be so interesting!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Let's not get too carried away by curiosity, Mio. The goal is a functional layout, not a social experiment. I'll be interested to see if the physical data actually matches our subjective complaints.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"I believe a little curiosity is a wonderful thing, Mio. It shows we care about our daily lives here. I look forward to hearing what all of you discover.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"We have a clear plan. Since we have already assigned the research tasks, I believe we can conclude this round. I will wait for the findings to be presented.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'll... I'll just wait for the results then. I hope the information I find is actually useful for everyone.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mio,,Me too! I'll be waiting with bated breath! Let's all share everything we find as soon as we get it!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I'm already on board with that. Let's just make sure we stick to the facts when we report back. I'll see you all in the next round.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
20,1,3,pass,Shunichi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
21,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I agree with Shunichi. Let us all take a moment to gather our information. I look forward to our next conversation.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
