61,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"Looking at our options, Rotating Blocks seems the most thoughtful. It allows us to share the light and the quiet, while still giving us time to bond and settle into our workstations.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Toshio,,I agree. Option C is the only choice that systematically addresses the inequality of the window seats and the noise levels without the daily inefficiency and bias of Option A.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I'm still a bit worried about the costs of moving, but Option C seems better than Option A. If we only move occasionally, it's more sustainable than daily changes. I'll vote for C.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Mio,,I'm with you all! Option C sounds perfect because it saves my morning gaps and stops the early birds from taking everything. I'm voting for Rotating Blocks too!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,"It's the only rational choice. Option A is a physical and logistical disaster, and Option B just ignores the environmental disparities. I'll vote for C to ensure we all get a turn in the quiet zone.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Shizue,,It is heartening to see us all in agreement. We have listened to each other's concerns and found a path that respects both our budget and our well-being. I am happy to cast my vote for Option C.,"{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Toshio,,The consensus is clear. Option C provides the necessary equity and stability we discussed. I will also cast my vote for Rotating Blocks.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I feel much better now that we've talked it through. Since everyone agrees and it seems like the most balanced way, I'll also vote for Option C.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Mio,,"Yay! I'm so glad we all agree! It feels great to have a plan that makes everyone happy. I'm officially voting for Option C, Rotating Blocks!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,No need to drag this out further. The logic is sound and the consensus is absolute. I'm voting for Option C.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"Since we have all reached a consensus, I believe we can conclude our discussion. It has been a pleasure working this out with all of you. I vote for Option C.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I concur. The decision is logically sound and addresses the core issues of fairness and stability. I vote for Option C.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'll vote for Option C as well. Thank you for being so understanding about my worries.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Mio,,"I'm so happy we all got along! This was way easier than I thought it would be. I vote for Option C, Rotating Blocks!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,I'll make it official. Option C is the only one that doesn't ignore the data. I vote for Rotating Blocks.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Shizue,,It has been a truly wonderful experience seeing us support one another. I am glad we found a way to be fair to everyone. My final vote is for Option C.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Toshio,,The process was efficient and the outcome is equitable. I cast my final vote for Option C.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'll cast my final vote for Option C too. I'm glad we could find a solution that works for everyone.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Mio,,"I'm so glad we're all on the same page! This is going to be great for the whole team. My final vote is for Option C, Rotating Blocks!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
80,3,4,talk,Shunichi,,My final vote is for Option C. It's the only choice that balances the physical data with the team's needs. Let's get it done.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
